{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/321243-fun-with-dual-kiths","id":321243,"title":"Fun with Dual Kiths","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-24T18:36:27-08:00","id":321243,"title":"Fun with Dual Kiths","content":"I've never played changeling, but I poke at the NWoD now and then.<br /> <br /> And, somehow I came across the dual kith merit, and I fell in love instantly. So now, I have but one request, show me what kinds of weird and thematic combinations are possible.<br /> <br /> Coldscales/Polychromatic: Chameleons, what else is there to say? Social focused, probably Winter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T19:17:51-08:00","id":321288,"title":"","content":"Chirurgeon/Razorhand: Battlefield medic who can defend himself in a pinch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T20:50:08-08:00","id":321356,"title":"","content":"Shadowsoul/Leechfinger: Did someone say Vampire?<br /> <br /> Hunterheart/Moonborn: Did someone say Werewolf?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T21:05:50-08:00","id":321363,"title":"","content":"Garguantuan/Earthbones: Monty Everest, the Living Mountain. As a plus, an Elemental Gargantuan with the Contracts of Mirror at 3+ is capable of getting ALL THE HEALTH BOXES. <br /> <br /> Smith or Artist/Render: Junkyard Jury-rigger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T03:25:39-08:00","id":321616,"title":"","content":"Shadowsoul/Lurker or Razorhand: Drow-Dark elf<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T16:44:25-08:00","id":326405,"title":"","content":"Dancer/Treasured: On the surface, they are opposites, but would make for a great Fairest who was used as a music box dancer. Eerie stillness until the music starts, then eerie grace.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/243-billionsix","name":"BillionSix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T18:03:01-08:00","id":326480,"title":"","content":"Beast Gargantuan/Hunterheart(or Coldscales, if you insist): IT'S GODZILLA!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T04:00:18-08:00","id":326821,"title":"","content":"Bright-one / Windwing : an Angel !<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3883-arabidopsis","name":"Arabidopsis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T18:04:54-08:00","id":328811,"title":"","content":"Gameplayer/Oracle, &quot;I swear, I'm not cheating. I'd never cheat you!&quot; Also known as the Gambling man, who knows when to fold 'em; when to walk away and when to run.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T05:35:27-08:00","id":329137,"title":"","content":"<b>Swimmerskin / Shadowsoul</b>: Shark Lawyer. Seriously. I did this. It was awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-04T09:04:33-08:00","id":330198,"title":"","content":"Might seem a bit obvious, but... Steepscrambler/Skitterskulk: Congratulations, you're playing changeling Spider-Man!<br /> <br /> Gristlegrinder/Water-Dweller: Jaws. Or Lake Placid. Or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-05T03:12:00-08:00","id":330947,"title":"","content":"We once did a trio of Roteaters as the hyenas from the Lion King. Shenzi was a Roteater/Shadowsoul, Banzai (me) was a Roteater/Gristlegrinder, and Ed (this time a girl) was a Roteater/Moonborn (though I think the Roteater parts were actually the secondary Kith and they were Fairest/Ogre/Darkling as Seemings).<br /> <br /> I've also done Sandharrowed/Gristlegrinder (sandworrrrrrrrrm). And once upon a time I had a Skitterskulk/Gargantuan Minister NPC whose transformation also made him into a giant spider... his boogieman persona was Pennywise. &gt;<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-05T08:19:06-08:00","id":331127,"title":"","content":"Venombite/Dancer: Cobra in a basket<br /> <br /> Flowering/Gristlegrinder: Venus flytrap<br /> <br /> Roteater/Gravewright: Maggot<br /> <br /> Skitterskulk/Blightbent: Lab rat<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T02:12:26-08:00","id":332066,"title":"","content":"Ive been threatening my GM with this one for a while; gargantuan/swimmerskin.... (Giant merit and the contract to make you larger) I'm a whale!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4190,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4190-nurseninja","user":"Nurseninja","date":". 12-06-2014, 05:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4190-nurseninja","name":"Nurseninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4190_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T04:15:08-08:00","id":332140,"title":"","content":"An Ogre with the Render/Berserker kiths + Quick Healer + Lethal Mien + Charmed Life + Stone 5 + Oath And Punishment 5 + Separation 5 = HULK SMASH!<br /> <br /> The Berseker kith can be found on the 1d4chan page of homebrew kiths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T07:19:41-08:00","id":340809,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://www.weregeek.com/comics/2014-12-11.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Weregeek is actually doing a C:tL LARP story arc right now, which is fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T18:29:56-08:00","id":344296,"title":"","content":"Fairest/Wood Elemental = Prince Nuada<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T16:18:48-07:00","id":475040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/321243-fun-with-dual-kiths?p=321356#post321356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shadowsoul/Leechfinger: Did someone say Vampire?<br /> <br /> Hunterheart/Moonborn: Did someone say Werewolf?</div> </div> </div> </div>A Darkling with the Whisperwisp/Wirestreaked/Mirrorskin kiths + Pledgesmith 3 + Token Maker and/or Hedgespinning Specialty + Rigid Mask + Vainglory 5 + Artifice 5 + Animation 3 + Devotees + Manymask + Wisdom Of Dreams + Lethal Mien + Goblin Vows for Lies and Computers + a hi-tech Hollow + scientific-ish Talecrafting = you are playing an Unchained Demon! The Wirestreaked kith can be found <a href=\"http://1d4chan.org/wiki/Changeling_Homebrew_Kiths#Wirestreaked\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T16:26:11-07:00","id":475047,"title":"","content":"Bloodbrute + Truefriend...<br /> <br /> Minsc and Boo stand ready!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T16:30:56-07:00","id":475050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/321243-fun-with-dual-kiths?p=340809#post340809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"http://www.weregeek.com/comics/2014-12-11.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Weregeek is actually doing a C:tL LARP story arc right now, which is fun.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Where be the first page to it? I would like to read it from the start of the arc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T17:32:43-07:00","id":475095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/321243-fun-with-dual-kiths?p=475050#post475050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where be the first page to it? I would like to read it from the start of the arc.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://www.weregeek.com/2014/11/05/\" target=\"_blank\">This page</a> is the first one following the end of the last chapter (and guest week). The Changeling game gets its first mention a few pages later, and comes up more prominently soon after that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T00:42:36-07:00","id":477634,"title":"","content":"I always liked using Wyrd Evolution rules in my game. You start with one Kith, but gain another at Wyrd 3, 6, and 9. By the end, the overlapping abilities often led to really interesting niche specialization and role formation. I had one player start out with a Lurkglider Darkling, who developed the Oracle Kith at Wyrd 3 and became the &quot;Ill Omen&quot;. At high Wyrd, she became a wandering dire portent that flitted through the air, never touching the ground. Another started as a Cyclopean Ogre and added in the Farwalker Kith to become the &quot;Creature of the Wood&quot;; it informed their later development of the Wanderlust derangement and a bane of being hypnotized by rain.<br /> <br /> I've always wanted to see someone make an aquatic muse just so they could be a &quot;Caller in the Deep&quot;. Hasn't happened, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T09:42:32-07:00","id":478017,"title":"","content":"<b>Gargantuan + Truefriend</b> = exotic and often dangerous pets of great size (i.e Bears, Tigers, Elephants, Anacondas, est)<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Draconic + Gameplayer</b> = Fairy Dragon, ever looking to expand its circle of friends and challenge them to harmless games of chance.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Oracle + Witchtooth</b> = Everybody respects your insight, but they don't visit you unless they are out of options.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Metalflesh + Mirrorskin</b> = Decepticon, transforms into inanimate objects instead of people.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Romancer + Larcenist</b> = Con Artist. Lure people in with honeyed words and charming looks, then rob them blind!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 04-12-2015, 12:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T17:40:57-07:00","id":478542,"title":"","content":"<b>Polychromatic + Windwing:</b> A Changeling that was a macaw in a great, eldritch forest.<br /> <br /> <b>Bright One + Moonborn:</b> It looks like Mother Luna, but only brings madness and a haunting, hypnotic glow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T10:36:40-07:00","id":479236,"title":"","content":"There was this Keeper who loved celebrations of all kinds. He'd heard about this one, but couldn't find anyone who could tell him about it, so he had to work it out on his own.<br /> <br /> He started with a Windwing with owl like traits, and added to that goat-like traits of a Broadback.<br /> <br /> When he was done, he had himself a right ole Hootin-Nanny! YEEHAW!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T16:41:27-07:00","id":480904,"title":"","content":"<b>Runnerswift + Chirugeon</b> = Unicorn. A magical, single-horned equine with the power to cleanse disease and toxins. Legend has it they can only be captured by virgins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T14:45:02-07:00","id":483903,"title":"","content":"I've played an Iceheart/Gargantuan frost giant and an Earthbones/Gargantuan walking mountain before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}